# Nexus AI runs fully client-side + one Vercel serverless function
# (api/chat.ts) — there is no database/backend to configure locally.
#
# Set these as Environment Variables in your Vercel project
# (Project Settings -> Environment Variables), NOT in this file:
#   GROQ_API_KEY        - https://console.groq.com/keys
#   GEMINI_API_KEY      - https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY  - https://openrouter.ai/keys  (optional)
#
# Accounts, chat history, documents, and settings are all stored locally
# in the browser (localStorage) — no other configuration is needed.
